flowchart LR
    P[Push to main]:::evt --> A[Workflow A: CI<br/>runs tests]:::wfa
    A --> C{CI<br/>succeeded?}:::gate
    C -->|yes| B[Workflow B: Deploy<br/>triggered by workflow_run]:::wfb
    C -->|no| X[Deploy does not run]:::finish

    classDef evt fill:#E8F4FA,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:2px,color:#1F3864,font-weight:bold
    classDef wfa fill:#D5E8F4,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:2px,color:#1F3864,font-weight:bold
    classDef wfb fill:#BFDBED,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:3px,color:#1F3864,font-weight:bold
    classDef gate fill:#E8F4FA,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:2px,color:#1F3864,font-weight:bold
    classDef finish fill:#E8F4FA,stroke:#1F3864,stroke-width:1px,color:#1F3864
